# Issue #1062: the sitemap's lastmod is the UTC day of each source's last Git
# commit, so it is generated from the deploying checkout and never committed.
# Only this one file: every other generated page stays tracked and is compared
# byte-for-byte against the build.
/public/sitemap.xml
